                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">MLGB2 attributes this volume alone to
                        Winchester, but the phrasing of the ex libris and the high price it records
                        suggests that the other volumes in the set of Panormitanus which is now
                        *E.15.22-24 (7 volumes in three) may also have been given by Avington to the
                        cathedral priory.</note>
